  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_horn_cb5ce70f07e07095783e8bad9fcc8fbe8e6469be57760f406af16404c0bbb4e39c">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Horn (the natural material): the horn of an animal, used as a raw material (for lanterns, knife-handles, crossbow-making, etc.). For type-specific and worked forms see the related concepts; genuinely unidentifiable "horn" occurrences are kept under horn_3.</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
